at she must act quickly, and knowing that the others may not trust her, she takes a chance and asks for help. Will it be enough?","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10716765/screencap/671351777d14e.jpg"},{"title":"My Fiance Is Trying His Best to Woo Me and I Don`t Know What to Do About It","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18013","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164299","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55150","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"244624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"434310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"86389","synopsis":"Hadis must deal with Marquess Beil and his men. Will knowing Jill's wishes make a difference? And for Jill, hearing the heartless words the marquess hurls at Hadis makes her worry that Hadis pushes himself too hard.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10716766/screencap/671c85f6ab8a3.jpg"},{"title":"When Seeking the Truth, Things Turned Into an Argument, So I Can No Longer Do Anything","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18013","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164299","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55150","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"244624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"434310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"86487","synopsis":"Prince Gerald goes to Beilburg to see if it's true that Jill was abducted. To deny the rumors, Hadis and Jill must show that they're happy, but it may not be so easy. Then their meeting with Gerald is cut short by distressing news of Marquess Beil.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10716767/screencap/6725c0d43a6c4.jpg"},{"title":"Upstarts Are Attempting to Get Close to My Fiance and I Want to Beat Them at Their Own Game","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18013","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164299","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55150","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"244624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"434310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"86583","synopsis":"Hadis' enemies are conspiring against him. Jill has secretly worked out a plan to protect him, but she's locked inside a barrier and Rave won't let her out. Instead, he tells her the real reason she was chosen as the Dragon Consort.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10716768/screencap/672f08960b8bb.jpg"},{"title":"I Want to Stop Living the Slow Life, So I Have Decided to Start in the Dragon Knights","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"18013","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164299","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55150","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"244624","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"434310","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"86663","synopsis":"Hadis, Jill, and the others head to the imperial capital, Rahelm. As they near the city, they're suddenly attacked! Jill and the others spring into action. Amidst the fighting, the leader of the other forces accuses Hadis of being a false emperor.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10716769/screencap/6738438841e58.jpg"},{"title":"I, the Dragon Consort, Am Now Hated by the Dragon and I Want to Find a Way to Be Friendly Again","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"external